{
  "id": "ep205",
  "duration": 57.035,
  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 4.547,
      "text": "Space is a silent vacuum, except for one massive cosmic singer.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "designed card"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 4.533,
          "kind": "designed",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 4.547,
      "end": 9.642,
      "text": "Most people assume sound cannot travel through the total emptiness of space.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Abell 426 with 8 inch RC.jpg",
        "credit": "Brainandforce",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Abell_426_with_8_inch_RC.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 4.533,
          "end": 8.033,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 8.033,
          "end": 9.633,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 9.642,
      "end": 15.462,
      "text": "But the Perseus Cluster, 250 million light-years away, is filled with hot gas.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Perseus A- Chandra Catches Cannibal Galaxy in the Act (2000-perseus - asmooth).tiff",
        "credit": "NASA/IoA/A.Fabian et al.",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Perseus_A-_Chandra_Catches_Cannibal_Galaxy_in_the_Act_(2000-perseus_-_asmooth).tiff"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 9.633,
          "end": 12.533,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 12.533,
          "end": 15.467,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 15.462,
      "end": 23.282,
      "text": "In 2002, NASA's Chandra X-ray Observatory detected real pressure waves rippling through that gas.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Chandra X-ray Image of Perseus A (2008-perseus-more-1).jpg",
        "credit": "(Credit: NASA/CXC/IoA/A.Fabian et al)",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chandra_X-ray_Image_of_Perseus_A_(2008-perseus-more-1).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 15.467,
          "end": 23.267,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 23.282,
      "end": 31.302,
      "text": "A supermassive black hole in galaxy NGC 1275 is blowing plasma bubbles, creating a cosmic hum.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Chandra Image of Perseus Cluster with Overlay of Low Pressure Region (2005-perseus-more-1 - perseus pressure).jpg",
        "credit": "(Credit: NASA/CXC/IoA/J.Sanders et al.)",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chandra_Image_of_Perseus_Cluster_with_Overlay_of_Low_Pressure_Region_(2005-perseus-more-1_-_perseus_pressure).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 23.267,
          "end": 31.3,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 31.302,
      "end": 38.522,
      "text": "Astronomers at Cambridge University found this hum is a B-flat note 57 octaves below middle C.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "designed card"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 31.3,
          "end": 38.533,
          "kind": "designed",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 38.522,
      "end": 44.547,
      "text": "A single oscillation of this deep sound wave takes nearly ten million years to complete.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Artist\u2019s Illustration of Multi-Messenger Event (noirlab2421a).jpg",
        "credit": "Rubin Observatory/NOIRLab/NSF/AURA/P. Marenfeld",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Artist%E2%80%99s_Illustration_of_Multi-Messenger_Event_(noirlab2421a).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 38.533,
          "end": 42.133,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 42.133,
          "end": 44.533,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 44.547,
      "end": 51.747,
      "text": "This sound carries the energy of 100 million supernovae, keeping the cluster too hot to form stars.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Illustration of Active Galactic Nucleus (2007-agns - accretiondisk torus).tiff",
        "credit": "NASA/CXC/Ohio State Univ./J.Eastman et al",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Illustration_of_Active_Galactic_Nucleus_(2007-agns_-_accretiondisk_torus).tiff"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 44.533,
          "end": 51.733,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 51.747,
      "end": 56.685,
      "text": "It is a deep, eternal vibration, yet most still believe the universe is silent.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "designed card"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 51.733,
          "end": 57.033,
          "kind": "designed",
          "motion": "camera"
